      },
      "notes": "Schematic U2–U5. B = U2, the input amp (gain 1 + 5.1k/1k = 6.1). A = U3, C = U4, D = U5: unity-gain buffers for the high, mid and low bands."
    },
    {
      "ref": "IC2",
      "kind": "opamp",
      "value": "OP484",
      "package": "dip14_quad_opamp",
      "pins": {
