        "OUT C": "Out",
        "IN-C": "OutFB",
        "IN+C": "Sum",
        "IN+D": "Compare",
        "IN-D": "+3.375V",
        "OUT D": "LED",
        "V+": "V+",
        "V-": "V-"
      },
      "notes": "Schematic U1, U8, U6, U7. B = U1, the speaker buffer. A = U8, the buffer feeding the peak detector. C = U6, the output amp (gain 1 + 300k/100k = 4). D = U7, the comparator that lights the LED."
    },
